    <Description>&lt;HTML&gt;&lt;BODY&gt;&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;font-family:Segoe UI;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:13;color:#333333;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;rotAIR Profile – Dual Encoder Module (GC &amp;amp; ANA)&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;This profile enables the full use of the rotAIR device, integrating two encoder modules for both Glass Cockpit (GC) and Analog (ANA) general aviation configurations in Microsoft Flight Simulator (MSFS).&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;It is based on default SimConnect variables and events, ensuring compatibility with most default and standard-based aircraft.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;No external scripts required &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;- all logic is built directly into SPAD.neXt.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;&lt;/HTML&gt;</Description>
